&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. *&lt;u&gt;Michael Snyder, DPSST No. 60486; Reedsport Police Department - Nomination for Medal of Honor&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Presented by Phil Castle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

