&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Pacific Power offers a range of energy&amp;nbsp;assistance&amp;nbsp;programs, including&amp;nbsp;income-qualified&amp;nbsp;discounts, weatherization&amp;nbsp;support&amp;nbsp;and resources for customers managing high bills. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PacificPower.net/Assistance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;or call&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;888-221-7070.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:calibri,calibri_embeddedfont,calibri_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

