&lt;p&gt;You can get this document for free in other languages, large print, braille or a format you need. Email &lt;a href="mailto:dd.directorsoffice@odhs.oregon.gov"&gt;dd.directorsoffice@odhs.oregon.gov&lt;/a&gt; or call 503-945-5811. We accept all relay calls.&lt;/p&gt;

